{"id":"forecast-13","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-13/audio-2.mp3","model":"small","duration":426.94,"segments":[{"start":0.82,"end":9.04,"text":"Part 2. You will hear a man called John Davies, who is the chairman of a photography club, giving","words":[["Part",0.82,1.26],["2.",1.26,1.68],["You",2.98,3.18],["will",3.18,3.4],["hear",3.4,3.62],["a",3.62,3.78],["man",3.78,4.1],["called",4.1,4.48],["John",4.48,4.94],["Davies,",4.94,5.58],["who",5.9,6.12],["is",6.12,6.28],["the",6.28,6.44],["chairman",6.44,6.76],["of",6.76,7.08],["a",7.08,7.2],["photography",7.2,7.6],["club,",7.6,8.14],["giving",8.74,9.04]]},{"start":9.04,"end":15.82,"text":"some information to members of the club. First you have some time to look at questions 11-16.","words":[["some",9.04,9.3],["information",9.3,9.88],["to",9.88,10.24],["members",10.24,10.54],["of",10.54,10.82],["the",10.82,10.94],["club.",10.94,11.26],["First",12.06,12.78],["you",12.78,12.98],["have",12.98,13.12],["some",13.12,13.28],["time",13.28,13.66],["to",13.66,13.9],["look",13.9,14.04],["at",14.04,14.18],["questions",14.18,14.54],["11",14.54,15.06],["-16.",15.06,15.82]]},{"start":46.46,"end":50.36,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 11-16.","words":[["Now",46.46,46.92],["listen",46.92,47.28],["carefully",47.28,47.78],["and",47.78,48.08],["answer",48.08,48.5],["questions",48.5,48.96],["11",48.96,49.52],["-16.",49.52,50.36]]},{"start":54.09,"end":61.31,"text":"Hi everyone. My name's John Davies. Welcome to this month's photography club. I'm very","words":[["Hi",54.09,54.59],["everyone.",54.59,55.01],["My",55.69,55.97],["name's",55.97,56.39],["John",56.39,56.65],["Davies.",56.65,57.21],["Welcome",57.75,58.13],["to",58.13,58.49],["this",58.49,58.67],["month's",58.67,59.05],["photography",59.05,59.45],["club.",59.45,59.89],["I'm",60.51,61.07],["very",61.07,61.31]]},{"start":61.31,"end":66.63,"text":"very pleased to see a few new members in the audience, and I hope you find the club both","words":[["very",61.