art":320.34,"end":326.98,"text":"The company is suitable for people with any level of photographic expertise, and I learned","words":[["The",320.34,320.72],["company",320.72,321.1],["is",321.1,321.62],["suitable",321.62,321.94],["for",321.94,322.36],["people",322.36,322.64],["with",322.64,323.14],["any",323.14,323.56],["level",323.56,323.96],["of",323.96,324.16],["photographic",324.16,324.94],["expertise,",324.94,325.56],["and",326.2,326.58],["I",326.58,326.78],["learned",326.78,326.98]]},{"start":326.98,"end":334.44,"text":"a lot from the other guests. The only extras you need to pay for are flights and you'll","words":[["a",326.98,327.16],["lot",327.16,327.38],["from",327.38,327.7],["the",327.7,327.84],["other",327.84,328.04],["guests.",328.04,328.42],["The",329.54,329.86],["only",329.86,330.38],["extras",330.38,330.82],["you",330.82,331.12],["need",331.12,331.32],["to",331.32,331.56],["pay",331.56,331.68],["for",331.68,332.04],["are",332.04,332.66],["flights",332.66,333.06],["and",333.06,334.1],["you'll",334.1,334.44]]},{"start":334.44,"end":340.78,"text":"also need to organise your own transfers to the accommodation when you arrive. Otherwise,","words":[["also",334.44,334.72],["need",334.72,335.08],["to",335.08,335.28],["organise",335.28,335.64],["your",335.64,335.98],["own",335.98,336.18],["transfers",336.18,336.74],["to",336.74,337.56],["the",337.56,337.76],["accommodation",337.76,338.36],["when",338.36,338.84],["you",338.84,339.04],["arrive.",339.04,339.46],["Otherwise,",340.32,340.78]]},{"start":341.34,"end":347.76,"text":"it's all inclusive and I have to say the catering was excellent, particularly the","words":[["it's",341.34,341.82],["all",341.82,342.04],["inclusive",342.04,342.5],["and",342.5,343.38],["I",343.38,343.54],["have",343.54,343.68],["to",343.68,343.8],["say",343.8,344.14],["the",344.14,344.6],["catering",344.6,345.16],["was",345.16,345.42],["excellent,",345.42,346.12],["particularly",346.54,347.32],["the",347.32,347.76]]},{"start":347.76,"end":356.0,"text":"breakfasts. So, what did I think of the holiday? Well, everything was very well","words":[["breakfasts.",347.76,348.62],["So,",349.2,349.8],["what",350.38,350.92],["did",350.92,351.16],["I",351.16,351.34],["think",351.34,351.58],["of",351.58,351.82],["the",351.82,351.94],["holiday?",351.94,352.28],["Well,",352.84,353.16],["everything",354.04,354.68],["was",354.68,355.44],["very",355.44,355.74],["well",355.74,356.0]]},{"start":356.0,"end":362.92,"text":"organised and the guides were great at finding wildlife for us to photograph. Even if one","words":[["organised",356.0,356.36],["and",356.36,356.98],["the",356.98,357.12],["guides",357.12,357.46],["were",357.46,357.8],["great",357.8,358.22],["at",358.22,358.54],["finding",358.54,358.82],["wildlife",358.82,359.36],["for",359.36,359.92],["us",359.92,360.08],["to",360.08,360.24],["photograph.",360.24,360.66],["Even",361.82,362.46],["if",362.46,362.7],["one",362.7,362.92]]},{"start":362.92,"end":369.58,"text":"morning we didn't see a lion or elephant there was always something to snap. There were some","words":[["morning",362.92,363.24],["we",363.24,363.54],["didn't",363.54,363.94],["see",363.94,364.16],["a",364.16,364.34],["lion",364.34,364.62],["or",364.62,364.84],["elephant",364.84,365.28],["there",365.28,366.04],["was",366.04,366.22],["always",366.22,366.62],["something",366.62,367.18],["to",367.18,367.46],["snap.",367.46,367.72],["There",368.74,369.24],["were",369.24,369.38],["some",369.38,369.58]]},{"start":369.58,"end":375.04,"text":"people there who weren't into photography and were there just for a holiday, like my","words":[["people",369.58,369.9],["there",369.9,370.28],["who",370.28,370.76],["weren't",370.76,371.08],["into",371.08,371.3],["photography",371.3,371.8],["and",371.8,372.66],["were",372.66,372.78],["there",372.78,373.08],["just",373.08,373.48],["for",373.48,373.72],["a",373.72,373.82],["holiday,",373.82,374.18],["like",374.58,374.84],["my",374.84,375.04]]},{"start":375.04,"end":382.58,"text":"wife, but even they had fun and found lots to see and do. I do think, however, that","words":[["wife,",375.04,375.36],["but",375.88,376.16],["even",376.16,376.44],["they",376.44,376.68],["had",376.68,376.92],["fun",376.92,377.28],["and",377.28,377.8],["found",377.8,378.22],["lots",378.22,378.56],["to",378.56,378.86],["see",378.86,379.14],["and",379.14,379.34],["do.",379.34,379.58],["I",380.32,380.84],["do",380.84,381.04],["think,",381.04,381.28],["however,",381.44,381.72],["that",382.32,382.58]]},{"start":382.58,"end":389.3,"text":"But more information should be given, like about what to wear. I had on a blue denim","words":[["But",382.58,382.68],["more",382.68,382.86],["information",382.86,383.5],["should",383.5,383.92],["be",383.92,384.08],["given,",384.08,384.38],["like",384.74,385.08],["about",385.08,385.54],["what",385.54,385.8],["to",385.8,386.06],["wear.",386.06,386.38],["I",387.16,387.66],["had",387.66,388.2],["on",388.2,388.46],["a",388.46,388.6],["blue",388.6,388.94],["denim",388.94,389.3]]},{"start":389.3,"end":395.2,"text":"shirt one night, and quickly had to change, as the colour apparently attracts certain","words":[["shirt",389.3,389.8],["one",389.8,390.1],["night,",390.1,390.42],["and",390.92,391.1],["quickly",391.1,391.38],["had",391.38,391.6],["to",391.6,391.72],["change,",391.72,392.14],["as",392.48,392.7],["the",392.7,392.84],["colour",392.84,393.16],["apparently",393.16,394.06],["attracts",394.06,394.66],["certain",394.66,395.2]]},{"start":395.2,"end":402.82,"text":"nasty insects. And we went in May and later found out that June to October would have","words":[["nasty",395.2,395.7],["insects.",395.7,396.26],["And",397.42,398.08],["we",398.08,398.38],["went",398.38,398.6],["in",398.6,398.82],["May",398.82,399.1],["and",399.1,399.64],["later",399.64,399.9],["found",399.9,400.18],["out",400.18,400.42],["that",400.42,400.64],["June",400.64,401.12],["to",401.12,401.44],["October",401.44,401.96],["would",401.96,402.68],["have",402.68,402.82]]},{"start":402.82,"end":409.44,"text":"been a better time for spotting wildlife. So what advice would I give to anyone?","words":[["been",402.82,402.98],["a",402.98,403.1],["better",403.1,403.32],["time",403.32,403.8],["for",403.8,404.12],["spotting",404.12,404.6],["wildlife.",404.6,405.08],["So",406.26,406.86],["what",406.86,407.68],["advice",407.68,408.14],["would",408.14,408.52],["I",408.52,408.66],["give",408.66,408.86],["to",408.86,409.08],["anyone?",409.08,409.44]]},{"start":409.44,"end":419.49,"text":"That is the end of part two. You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to part two.","words":[["That",409.44,410.54],["is",413.39,413.55],["the",413.55,413.69],["end",413.69,414.05],["of",414.05,414.21],["part",414.21,414.39],["two.",414.39,414.77],["You",415.49,416.05],["now",416.05,416.31],["have",416.31,416.63],["30",416.63,417.01],["seconds",417.01,417.43],["to",417.43,417.79],["check",417.79,418.07],["your",418.07,418.27],["answers",418.27,418.63],["to",418.63,418.91],["part",418.91,419.13],["two.",419.13,419.49]]}]}